02:29:51.479 --> 02:29:53.279
which is slightly different.

02:29:53.279 --> 02:29:56.239
But they're all gonna do ultimately the same thing.

02:29:58.039 --> 02:30:00.539
So then these Ps, when you see these on this slide,

02:30:00.540 --> 02:30:04.040
These Ps are for partial application.

02:30:04.040 --> 02:30:06.700
So would add five still be curried?

02:30:06.700 --> 02:30:07.880
What would that be?

02:30:07.880 --> 02:30:08.700
What's your question?

02:30:08.700 --> 02:30:09.940
